        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Client\n    participant Auth as auth-service\n    participant Cache as Redis&lt;br/&gt;(idempotency cache)\n    participant Fraud as fraud-service\n    participant DB as Postgres&lt;br/&gt;(auth-service)\n    participant Kafka as Kafka topic:&lt;br/&gt;auth.events\n    participant Ledger as ledger-service\n    participant LDB as Postgres&lt;br/&gt;(ledger-service)\n    Note over Client, LDB: Happy path only - see per-flow sequence diagrams&lt;br/&gt;(authorise/capture/reverse-sequence.mmd) for idempotency,&lt;br/&gt;concurrency, and failure handling\n    Client -&gt;&gt; Auth: POST /authorisations&lt;br/&gt;(authorise, amount, idempotencyKey)\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; Cache: check idempotency key\n    Cache --&gt;&gt; Auth: cache miss\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; DB: check idempotency key&lt;br/&gt;(best-effort pre-check, before paying&lt;br/&gt;for a fraud-service call)\n    DB --&gt;&gt; Auth: not found\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; DB: findById(accountId)&lt;br/&gt;(account-active gate)\n    DB --&gt;&gt; Auth: account (status=ACTIVE)\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; Fraud: POST /fraud/check\n    Fraud --&gt;&gt; Auth: APPROVE\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; DB: reserve funds +&lt;br/&gt;save authorisation (AUTHORISED)&lt;br/&gt;+ outbox event\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; Cache: store response (TTL)\n    Auth --&gt;&gt; Client: 201 Created (AUTHORISED)\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; Kafka: publish AUTHORISATION_AUTHORISED&lt;br/&gt;(outbox poller)\n    Kafka --&gt;&gt; Ledger: consume&lt;br/&gt;AUTHORISATION_AUTHORISED\n    Ledger -&gt;&gt; LDB: save ledger entry +&lt;br/&gt;event log\n    Client -&gt;&gt; Auth: POST /authorisations/{id}/captures&lt;br/&gt;(idempotencyKey)\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; DB: settle reserved funds +&lt;br/&gt;save authorisation (CAPTURED)&lt;br/&gt;+ outbox event\n    Auth --&gt;&gt; Client: 200 OK (CAPTURED)\n    Auth -&gt;&gt; Kafka: publish AUTHORISATION_CAPTURED&lt;br/&gt;(outbox poller)\n    Kafka --&gt;&gt; Ledger: consume&lt;br/&gt;AUTHORISATION_CAPTURED\n    Ledger -&gt;&gt; LDB: save ledger entry +&lt;br/&gt;event log\n\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="60z0sTnrv71LFocaW1mY-1">
